This conversion adapts the InstanceNorm.forward implementation from
chronos/chronos_bolt.py. The zero-scale epsilon is emitted with torch.full_like
to retain Float32 precision in Core AI. Its formula and inherited inverse
remain unchanged. The original official reference model is not modified.

The conversion wrapper selects one series and one 16-step output patch.
Local export decompositions replace isnan(x) with x != x and complete
nonoverlapping last-axis size=stride=16 unfold with reshape. The decomposition
table is copied for this export. No model weights or quantile ordering are
changed. Core AI packaging and verification are maintained by coreai-samples.

